Type: Package
Package: pigheatmap
Title: Performance Heatmaps for Swine Production Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Your", "Name", , "mguo2023331@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Aggregates production records (e.g. litter size by parity and
    month) and draws annotated heatmaps with rich-text cell labels,
    optional faceting, sample-size based transparency, and segmented
    colour scales for traits that have empirical optimal ranges (parity,
    backfat, age at first mating, ...).
